        "documentsRequired_md": "&amp;gt; **For DBT Registration Process:**\n\n\n\n      1. Aadhaar Details (Should be linked with mobile number).\n      1. Passport Size Photo.\n      1. Farmer details.\n      1. Land information.\n      1. Bank account.\n\n\n&amp;gt; **For the Online Application of the Scheme:**\n\n\n\n      1. Passport Size Photo.\n      1. [Contract form](https://horticulture.bihar.gov.in/HortMIS/AreaExpansionStateScheme/Documents/SchemeDocuments/Ekrarnama.pdf) ( for non-ryot farmers).      1. Land Possession Certificate (LPC)/ revenue receipt (If applicable).\n\n\n&amp;gt; **Note:** If the applicant&amp;amp;#39;s name is not clear in the land-ownership/ revenue receipt, it will be mandatory to attach the genealogy along with the land-ownership/ revenue receipt.\n\n",
